# ==========================================
# ORBITCREW - Environment Variables
# ==========================================

# --- SUPABASE CONFIGURATION ---
# Get these from your Supabase project dashboard
# https://app.supabase.com/project/_/settings/api

# Your Supabase project URL
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co

# Anonymous key (public, safe to expose in frontend)
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# --- EMAIL (Resend) ---
# Sign up at https://resend.com (free tier available)
RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxx

# --- WHATSAPP (Twilio) ---
# Sign up at https://twilio.com
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=your-account-sid
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=your-auth-token
TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER=+1234567890

# --- ADMIN CREDENTIALS ---
# Create user in Supabase Authentication
ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@orbitcrew.ai

# ==========================================
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS
# ==========================================

# 1. Create Supabase project:
#    - Go to https://supabase.com and create new project
#    - Note your project URL and anon key

# 2. Run database schema:
#    - Copy contents of supabase/migrations/001_initial_schema.sql
#    - Run in Supabase SQL Editor

# 3. Configure environment:
#    - Copy this file to .env
#    - Fill in your actual values

# 4. Deploy Edge Function (optional):
#    - Install: npm install -g supabase
#    - Run: supabase functions serve submit-lead
#    - Or skip - form works with direct database inserts

# 5. Test:
#    - npm run dev
#    - Submit contact form
#    - Check Supabase dashboard for new leads